                    },
                    "message": "Anything about what association this is? Probably connected_to, connecting \nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/blob/dffc8a8c49797822d60c52550943257aea3ee2a4/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Item/FabricAdapter.interface.yaml#L11"
