                    },
                    "message": "Added information on association."
                },
                {
                    "file": "designs/pcie-port-properties.md",
                    "line": 55,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "Why do you need a new interface and not https://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/blob/dffc8a8c49797822d60c52550943257aea3ee2a4/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Inventory/Connector/Port.interface.yaml ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "designs/pcie-port-properties.md",
                    "line": 55,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "We also need DBus properties for port type, current speed and\nactive width. That interface does not have these properties. Should we add these properties to that interface?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "designs/pcie-port-properties.md",
                    "line": 55,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "designs/pcie-port-properties.md",
                    "line": 65,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "How is Metric.Value tried to a port / pcie device ? Another association?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "designs/pcie-port-properties.md",
                    "line": 65,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "No. Since PCIe Device and PCIe Port are already part of DBus Object path, an\nexplicit association is not required. Made it explicit in design doc."
                },
                {
                    "file": "designs/pcie-port-properties.md",
                    "line": 89,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Gunnar Mills",
                        "email": "gunnar@gmills.xyz",
                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "any application could put these interfaces / associations out right?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "designs/pcie-port-properties.md",
                    "line": 89,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, any app can put these interfaces and bmcweb should pick it up correctly."
                }
            ],
