                        "name": "aishwaryjoshi31",
                        "email": "aishwaryjoshi31@gmail.com",
                        "username": "aishwaryjoshi31"
                    },
                    "message": "PCIE port under consideration is for which hardware component ?\n\nAsking this because, as per schema https://redfish.dmtf.org/schemas/v1/Port_v1.xml Port resource can be present under various resources. Eg\n/redfish/v1/Systems/{ComputerSystemId}/Processors/{ProcessorId}/Ports/{PortId}\n\n\nSo how did we decide to be under System URI ?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "designs/pcie-port-properties.md",
                    "line": 26,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Harshit Aghera",
                        "email": "haghera@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "harshit-aghera"
                    },
                    "message": "URI /redfish/v1/Systems/system/PCIeDevices/{PCIeDevice}/ is already supported in bmcweb and extending it seemed to a better alternative over defining a new route handler in bmcweb."
                }
            ],
